   "source": [
    "## 2. Scaffold design\n",
    "\n",
    "Sampling starts from pure noise: backbone and sequence are generated together, constrained\n",
    "throughout by the motif geometry. This is the de novo step, and the one with the lowest pass rate."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eab56fe5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Settings — scaffold generation\n",
    "\n",
    "- `NUM_DESIGNS` — how many designs to sample. Only a fraction will pass all three criteria, so\n",
    "  sample generously; 25 is enough to see the workflow, more if you intend to pick from the results.\n",
    "- `BATCH_SIZE` — per-GPU batch size.\n",
    "- `NSTEPS`, `GUIDANCE_W` — diffusion steps and guidance weight; `None` keeps the config defaults."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "375744d2",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-07-21T17:04:33.227722Z",
