  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba81d3bc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Carry the conditions onto the chosen design\n",
    "\n",
    "A generated CIF records **where the motif went** but does not carry the conditions forward — on\n",
    "the output, `C_CRD` and `C_SEQ` cover the ligand only. Feed it onward as-is and inverse folding\n",
    "will redesign the catalytic residues along with everything else; partial diffusion will let them\n",
    "drift. This step therefore stands between scaffolding and the two refinement steps that follow.\n",
    "\n",
    "`pick_and_prepare.py` ranks the designs by `ame.pass`, then by\n",
    "`design_unindexed_motif_allatom_rmsd`, and writes the winner to `best/`. It reads the\n",
    "`mapped_to_coordinate_conditioned_region` annotation, which marks exactly the atoms that came\n",
    "from the input's conditioned motif, so the per-residue atom selection is inherited rather than\n",
    "re-derived."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "12a22c18",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-07-21T17:16:35.825886Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-07-21T17:16:35.825712Z",
