   "source": [
    "### Verify before chaining\n",
    "\n",
    "Read the prepared CIF with the same function used on the theozyme in section 1. The conditioned\n",
    "atom counts must match: the catalytic geometry that was pinned going in is the geometry pinned\n",
    "going on. A mismatch here means the next two steps would optimise the wrong thing."
   ]
  },
