   "source": [
    "# ── Settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "IF_TEMPERATURE = 1.5   # sequence sampling noise scale; config default 0.1, raised for diversity\n",
    "IF_NUM_DESIGNS = 10    # how many sequences to design for this backbone\n",
    "# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "\n",
    "ov3 = [\"generation=inverse_folding\"]\n",
    "name3 = f\"T{tag(IF_TEMPERATURE)}_n{IF_NUM_DESIGNS}\"\n",
    "if IF_TEMPERATURE is not None:\n",
    "    ov3.append(f\"generation.model.local_latents.simulation_step_params.sc_scale_noise={IF_TEMPERATURE}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "OUT3 = str(OUT_ROOT / f\"inverse_folding_{name3}\")\n",
    "csv3 = launch(OUT3, \"s3invfold\", best_cif, IF_NUM_DESIGNS, ov3, BATCH_SIZE)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7fca88c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Results\n",
    "\n",
    "Two further columns report how far each design has moved from the parent scaffold:\n",
    "`ca_rmsd_to_parent` over Cα coordinates and `seq_ident_to_parent` over the sequence. Inverse\n",
    "folding holds the backbone, so the first stays at zero and the whole change appears in the second."
   ]
  },
